L["Healing Way"] = "治療之路"
L["Healing groups through dungeons from 10 to 59. Divine Intellect and Healing Light first, Reverence at 20 (mana keeps coming while you cast), then Illumination, Holy Shock at 30 for emergencies, Divine Favor and Holy Power, and Light's Vigil at 40 to heal the whole party at once. Your rest between pulls is what slows a group down, so mana talents come before anything else. Afterwards Benediction for cheaper Cleanse and Holy Shock, then Toughness, Guardian's Favor, Anticipation and Sacred Duty to survive mobs that turn on you."] = "從10到59級在地城中為隊伍治療。先點神聖智慧和治療之光，20級點崇敬（施法時法力持續回復），接著是啟發，30級點神聖震擊應急，神恩術和神聖之力，40級點聖光戒備一次治療整個隊伍。拖慢隊伍的是你在每波怪之間的休息，所以法力天賦優先於一切。之後點祈福讓清潔術和神聖震擊更便宜，再點堅韌、守護者的寵愛、預知和神聖職務，在怪物轉向你時活下來。"
L["Healing groups through dungeons with Discipline: Twin Disciplines and Improved Power Word: Shield first (Shield the tank on the pull), Meditation at 20 so mana keeps coming while you cast, Mental Strength, Penance at 30, Renewed Hope and Divine Aegis, then Holy for crits. Your rest between pulls is what slows a group, so mana talents come first. Downrank your heals."] = "以戒律在地城中為隊伍治療：先點雙生戒律和強化真言術：盾（開怪時給坦克上盾），20級點冥想讓施法時法力持續回復，接著是心靈之力，30級點懺悟，嶄新希望和神禦之盾，然後點神聖系提高致命一擊。拖慢隊伍的是你在每波怪之間的休息，所以法力天賦優先。治療法術請降級施放。"
L["Healing groups through dungeons with Holy talents: the Discipline mana talents and Holy Specialization first, then Divine Fury, Improved Renew, Improved Healing and Litany of Light, Spiritual Guidance and Spiritual Healing in the 50s and Prayer of Mending at 57. About 6% slower than the Discipline dungeon build in our model until Prayer of Mending, but it grows into the Holy raid healer."] = "以神聖天賦在地城中為隊伍治療：先點戒律的法力天賦和神聖專精，接著是神聖之怒、強化恢復、強化治療術和聖光連禱，50多級點精神導引和精神治療，57級點癒合禱言。在我們的模型中，拿到癒合禱言前比戒律地城配置慢約6%，但它會逐步成長為神聖團隊治療。"
L["Healing groups through dungeons: Improved Healing Wave and Mindfulness first, Water Shield at 20, Tidal Focus for cheaper heals, then Tidal Mastery, Healing Way, Mana Tide at 40 and Riptide. Your rest between pulls is what slows a group, so mana talents come first. Uses Gear Judge's healer dungeon weights."] = "在地城中為隊伍治療：先點強化治療波和正念，20級點水之盾，潮汐集中讓治療更便宜，接著是潮汐專精、治療之路，40級點法力之潮圖騰，然後是激流。拖慢隊伍的是你在每波怪之間的休息，所以法力天賦優先。使用 Gear Judge 的治療地城權重。"
L["Healing groups through dungeons: mana first (Heart of the Wild, Reflection, Gift of Nature, Gift of the Earthmother), then Improved Rejuvenation, Living Spirit and Improved Regrowth, with Swiftmend, Nature's Swiftness and Wild Growth near the end. Your rest between pulls is what slows a group. Uses Gear Judge's healer dungeon weights."] = "在地城中為隊伍治療：法力優先（野性之心、反射、自然賜福、大地之母賜福），接著是強化回春術、活化精神和強化癒合，迅癒、自然迅捷和野性痊癒放在最後。拖慢隊伍的是你在每波怪之間的休息。使用 Gear Judge 的治療地城權重。"
