L["Recommended raid tank. Conviction, Vindication and Improved Judgement instead of Iron Creed, Holy Conduit and Benediction: in the wowsims Forever simulator it makes the most threat of the Paladin tank builds and also takes the least damage (Vindication lowers the boss's attack power). Judgement on cooldown, Holy Shield always up. No mana talents: fine for a normal boss fight; watch your mana on long ones."] = "推薦的團隊坦克。以定罪、辯護和強化審判取代鐵之教條、神聖導體和祈福：在 wowsims Forever 模擬器中，它是聖騎士坦克配置中仇恨最高、承受傷害也最少的（辯護會降低首領的攻擊強度）。冷卻好就用審判，神聖之盾保持常駐。沒有法力天賦：一般首領戰沒問題；長時間戰鬥要注意法力。"
