L["Shadow for leveling through dungeons: Shadow Focus and Shadow Affinity first (less threat), then Mind Flay and Vampiric Embrace early so your Shadow damage heals the group, Shadow Weaving, Silence for casters, Shadowform at 40. Shadow Word: Pain on the kill target and anything the tank holds; let the tank build threat before Mind Blast."] = "在地城中練功的暗影配置：先點暗影集中和暗影親和（降低仇恨），接著盡早點精神鞭笞和吸血鬼的擁抱，讓你的暗影傷害治療隊伍，然後是暗影之波、對付施法者的沉默，40級點暗影形態。對擊殺目標和坦克穩住的所有怪上暗言術：痛；先讓坦克累積仇恨再用心靈震爆。"
L["Shadow priest tuned for solo questing: Spirit Tap and Shadow Focus first, wand to 28, then Mind Flay and Shadow Weaving; Vampiric Embrace self-heals, Improved Psychic Scream and Power Word: Shield cover a second mob. Shadowform at 40 (-15% physical, half-price Shadow mana), then Disc mana, Meditation and Soul Warding."] = "為單人解任務調整的暗影牧師：先點精神分流和暗影集中，28級前用魔杖，接著是精神鞭笞和暗影之波；吸血鬼的擁抱可自我治療，強化心靈尖嘯和真言術：盾能應付第二隻怪。40級點暗影形態（物理傷害-15%，暗影法術法力消耗減半），然後是戒律的法力天賦、冥想和靈魂結界。"
