L["Twist of Light"] = "聖光折射"
L["Two-Handed Weapon Specialization"] = "雙手武器專精"
L["Two-hander Arms for leveling through dungeons. Same core as the solo build, but Sweeping Strikes comes at 30 for packs (the next five attacks also hit a second target) and Improved Heroic Strike replaces Deflection, since the tank takes the hits. On packs use Sweeping Strikes, then Whirlwind (from 36, Berserker Stance) and Cleave; on bosses Rend, Overpower and Mortal Strike. Let the tank get a few Sunders in first."] = "在地城中練功的雙手武器配置。核心與單人配置相同，但30級就點橫掃攻擊對付成群的怪（接下來五次攻擊也會擊中第二個目標），並以強化英勇打擊取代偏斜，因為由坦克承受傷害。成群的怪先用橫掃攻擊，再用旋風斬（36級起，狂暴姿態）和順劈斬；首領用撕裂、壓制和致死打擊。先讓坦克上幾次破甲。"
L["Two-hander Arms for questing alone. Improved Rend first: keep Rend on every mob, and from 30 Bloodthrill turns your hits on a bleeding target into Overpower procs, your cheapest big hit (5 rage). Deep Wounds and Anger Management at 20, Two-Handed Specialization and Impale in the 20s, Weaponmaster with an axe or polearm, Mortal Strike at 40, then Cruelty and Unbridled Wrath for crit and rage. Spend rage on Overpower first, then Mortal Strike and Slam; finish mobs with Execute. About 11% faster than the old Arms leveling build in our model."] = "單人解任務的雙手武器配置。先點強化撕裂：讓每隻怪都保持撕裂，30級起鮮血快感會讓你對流血目標的攻擊觸發壓制，這是你最便宜的高傷害技能（5點怒氣）。20級點重傷和憤怒掌控，20多級點雙手武器專精和穿刺，用斧或長柄武器點武器大師，40級點致死打擊，然後點殘忍和怒不可遏提高致命一擊和怒氣。怒氣優先用在壓制，然後是致死打擊和猛擊；用斬殺收尾。在我們的模型中比舊的武器練功配置快約11%。"
L["Two-hander Retribution for leveling through dungeons. Same core as the solo build, plus the group tools: Repentance at 30 to take a humanoid out of a pull, and Instrument of Law at 40 (20% less threat without Righteous Fury, and an instant Hammer of Wrath) so you don't pull mobs off the tank. Holy Conduit comes early for cheaper Consecration on packs, and Purifying Power early for Exorcism against the Undead (Scarlet Monastery, Razorfen Downs, Stratholme, Scholomance). Open boss fights with Judgement of the Crusader; Seal of Command, Judgement and Holy Strike on cooldown; Consecration only once the tank holds the pack."] = "在地城中練功的雙手武器懲戒配置。核心與單人配置相同，另加上組隊工具：30級點懺悔讓一隻人型怪退出戰鬥，40級點法之公器（沒有正義之怒時仇恨降低20%，並讓憤怒之錘變為瞬發），讓你不會從坦克身上搶怪。神聖導體提早點，讓對付成群怪的奉獻更便宜；淨化能量也提早點，讓驅邪術能對付不死生物（血色修道院、剃刀高地、斯坦索姆、通靈學院）。首領戰以十字軍審判開場；冷卻好就用命令聖印、審判和神聖打擊；坦克穩住整群怪後才用奉獻。"
L["Two-hander Retribution for questing alone. Seal of Command at 20 and Sacred Arbiter at 25, then Pursuit of Justice (+15% run and mount speed) for faster travel between mobs, about 5% more kills an hour. Open every pull with Judgement of the Crusader, then Seal of Command: about 10% more kills an hour. Vengeance, Two-Handed Weapon Specialization and Champion of the Light through the 30s, Holy from 40 for Divine Strength, Improved Seals and mana. Skip Consecration on single mobs."] = "單人解任務的雙手武器懲戒配置。20級點命令聖印，25級點神聖仲裁者，然後點正義追擊（跑速和坐騎速度+15%）讓你在怪物之間移動更快，每小時擊殺數多約5%。每次開怪都先用十字軍審判，再上命令聖印：每小時擊殺數多約10%。30多級點復仇、雙手武器專精和光之勇士，40級起點神聖系的神聖之力、強化聖印和法力天賦。單隻怪不要用奉獻。"
